## CatC Jinja UDV scanner

- Static scan ignores `{% set %}` inside `{% for %}`. Dummy-declare loop vars at template scope (already done for `vrf`).
- `default((L3VNIOFFSET|string) + vrf.id)` does not parse as a declaration. Bare `{{ l3_vni }}` becomes a required Template Hub input (“Value should not be empty”).
- Site-105 `DEFN-VRF.j2` already has explicit `l3_vlan` / `l3_vni`. Prefer `{{ vrf['l3_vni'] }}` over a local `l3_vni`. `FABRIC-NVE.j2` was fixed locally; **not yet re-synced with `06`**.
